<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>자판기 봇</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    body {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background-color: #1a1d21;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .full-page-message {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px;
      max-width: 500px;
    }
    .full-page-message .icon {
      font-size: 64px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .full-page-message h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .full-page-message p {
      color: #b9bbbe;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .full-page-message .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background-color: #5865F2;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }
    .full-page-message .btn:hover {
      background-color: #4752c4;
    }
    .full-page-message .logout-link {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 24px;
      color: #72767d;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .full-page-message .logout-link:hover {
      color: #b9bbbe;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="full-page-message">
    <% if (serverLink) { %>
      <!-- 서버 링크가 있는 경우 -->
      <div class="icon">🔗</div>
      <h1>서버에 가입해주세요</h1>
      <p>자판기 봇을 사용하려면 먼저 디스코드 서버에 가입해야 합니다.</p>
      <a href="<%= serverLink %>" target="_blank" class="btn">
        🔗 서버에 가입하기
      </a>
      <br><br>
      <a href="/auth/logout" class="logout-link">🚪 로그아웃</a>
    <% } else { %>
      <!-- 서버 링크가 없는 경우 -->
      <div class="icon">🔧</div>
      <h1>🚧 페이지 준비 중입니다 🚧</h1>
      <p>현재 서비스가 준비 중입니다.<br>관리자에게 문의해주세요.</p>
      <a href="/auth/logout" class="logout-link">🚪 로그아웃</a>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</body>
</html>